  "prefLabel": "Ph 1809.05 Recordkeeping",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 1809.05 Recordkeeping. An advanced pharmacy technician who engages in the administration of vaccines shall, for a minimum of 4 years, keep a patient consent form that includes the:\n\n(a) Name and date of birth of the patient;\n\n(b) Name of the vaccine, manufacturer, lot number, and expiration date of the vaccine;\n\n(c) Description of the risks and possible side effects of the vaccine;\n\n(d) Date of administration;\n\n(e) Supervising pharmacist’s name;\n\n(f) Administering licensed pharmacy technician’s name; and\n\n(g) Signature of the patient.\n\nSource. #13463, eff 10-18-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ph100-2600.html"
